<http://localhost:8080/source/path_hsa00250> <http://knowdive.disi.unitn.it/etype#has_pathwayName> "Pathways of neurodegeneration - multiple diseases - Homo sapiens (human)"@en .
<http://localhost:8080/source/path_hsa00250> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
