<http://localhost:8080/source/path_hsa01100> <http://knowdive.disi.unitn.it/etype#has_pathwayName> "Herpes simplex virus 1 infection - Homo sapiens (human)"@en .
<http://localhost:8080/source/path_hsa01100> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://knowdive.disi.unitn.it/etype#Pathway> .

