<http://localhost:8080/source/P62195> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://knowdive.disi.unitn.it/etype#HostProtein> .
<http://localhost:8080/source/P62195> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<http://localhost:8080/source/path_hsa04350> <http://knowdive.disi.unitn.it/etype#has_pathwaySource> "https://www.kegg.jp/pathway/hsa05016"@en .
