<http://localhost:8080/source/path_hsa04390> <http://knowdive.disi.unitn.it/etype#has_pathwayCategory> "Human Diseases; Immune disease"@en .
<http://localhost:8080/source/P62807> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .

