<http://localhost:8080/source/path_hsa05010> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://knowdive.disi.unitn.it/etype#Pathway> .
<http://localhost:8080/source/path_hsa05010> <http://knowdive.disi.unitn.it/etype#has_pathwaySource> "https://www.kegg.jp/pathway/hsa04218"@en .
