<http://localhost:8080/source/P32942> <http://knowdive.disi.unitn.it/etype#has_involvedIn> <http://localhost:8080/source/path_hsa05014> .
<http://localhost:8080/source/P32942> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<http://localhost:8080/source/path_hsa05014> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://knowdive.disi.unitn.it/etype#Pathway> .
