<http://localhost:8080/source/path_hsa05322> <http://knowdive.disi.unitn.it/etype#has_pathwayName> "Viral carcinogenesis - Homo sapiens (human)"@en .
<http://localhost:8080/source/path_hsa05322> <http://knowdive.disi.unitn.it/etype#has_pathwaySource> "https://www.kegg.jp/pathway/hsa05203"@en .
<http://localhost:8080/source/Q09472> <http://knowdive.disi.unitn.it/etype#has_involvedIn> <http://localhost:8080/source/path_hsa05322> .
<http://localhost:8080/source/Q09472> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://knowdive.disi.unitn.it/etype#HostProtein> .
